&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: Hamburg, Berlin or Barcelona&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Freenow, we are on a mission to empower smarter mobility decisions, helping people to move freely and cities to thrive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; New Business&lt;/strong&gt; team. You will own a vertical focused on complex, high-value order types, the kind that don&#39;t fit into a simple A-to-B booking and require real product thinking to scale. Think multi-leg journeys, recurring enterprise needs, scheduled operations, and bespoke partner requirements. This list is not exhaustive the space is wide and still being defined.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will set the vision for your vertical, build the roadmap from scratch, and take full ownership of outcomes. This is not an execution role with a predefined plan. You are the one who creates the plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR DAILY ADVENTURES WILL INCLUDE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the product vision and long-term strategy for your vertical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and prioritize the roadmap based on commercial opportunity and operational impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear, detailed specifications that engineering teams can build from independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional alignment across Sales, Operations, Legal, and Core Tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve ambiguity early in requirements, in processes, and in stakeholder expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track KPIs and use data to validate direction and drive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
