&lt;li&gt;Background in marketplace, or operations-heavy products B2B/B2C&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to define product vision and build strategy, not just execute one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing complex stakeholder environments across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with incomplete information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written communication, your specs and documents set the standard for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed and accountable: you own outcomes, not just deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; German is a significant advantage&lt;/li&gt;
