&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, Global Price &amp;amp; Discount Strategy, you will shape the economics behind our global food solutions group and the world&#39;s leading meal kit company, active in 17 countries across 3 continents. You will shape how millions of customers experience our product, driving one of the company’s most impactful levers of growth: pricing and discounts. Challenges you’ll solve include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What is the right price positioning in each of our markets?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we acquire customers more cost-efficiently?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we design incentives that encourage customers to spend more with HelloFresh?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How can we leverage AI tooling to arrive at pricing insights and solutions faster than ever before?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be part of the Global Price &amp;amp; Discount Strategy Team, shaping pricing and discount strategy across our full global portfolio which includes our core brand, HelloFresh, as well as: Factor, GreenChef, EveryPlate, Chef&#39;s Plate, and Youfoodz. You’ll work closely with stakeholders from multiple countries and teams such as Product, Marketing Analytics, and Paid Marketing — making this a unique opportunity to combine strategic thinking, analytical depth, and cross-functional execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape market strategies: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor performance and competitor landscapes across our key markets, and translate insights into actionable price &amp;amp; discount strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run and scale experiments: &lt;/strong&gt;Design, align, and execute A/B tests that validate new pricing and promotional approaches, and ensure learnings are rigorously captured&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own key initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Take end-to-end responsibility for selected projects — from framing the problem and aligning stakeholders, to delivering impact through execution and tracking results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build frameworks &amp;amp; playbooks: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop best practices, toolkits, and scalable approaches that improve how we set prices and run promotions across all markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modernize processes with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Pricing Analytics and Product to adapt AI use cases within our pricing and discount strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in consulting, data analytics, or a price/discount-related role, with a strong track record of solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required, Master’s degree preferred in marketing, business or STEM-related fields (e.g. mathematics, engineering, computer science, economics, statistics, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, including advanced command of Excel (SQL is a plus) with the ability to translate complex data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience devising and measuring the effectiveness of strategic optimizations (including AB testing), with a proven track record from other data-rich business environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with diverse teams, including Product, Marketing, and Data Science, in a fast-paced, matrixed environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating ambiguity and adapting quickly to evolving priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
